      "chapter": "TSA 4.1",
      "requirement_text": "Each electronic control unit shall carry a serial number label containing the\nTessaly part number, the hardware revision, and the date of manufacture in the format\ndefined in TSA-LB-077. The label shall remain legible for the service life of the vehicle.\nThe label position is shown on drawing TSA-DRW-1188, sheet 2.",
